  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: left;\">Overview</h2>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">The product contains all the <strong>non-3D printed</strong> parts for assembling an entirely functional <span style=\"color: #333333;\"><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/450255-piano-music-box-bottom-winding-kit-k014#profileId-380745\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #333333;\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">Piano Music Box Bottom Winding Kit</span></strong></a></span> and <span style=\"color: #333333;\"><a href=\"https://makerworld.com/en/models/450264-piano-music-box-hand-winding-kit-k015?from=search#profileId-380719\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #333333;\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\">Piano Music Box Hand Winding Kit</span></strong></a></span>. To complete the work, you also need to download the <strong>model files</strong> and <strong>3D print</strong> the remaining parts.<span></span></p>\n<!--Overview部分（无需改动）--></div>\n<!--图片展示-->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 20px; font-size: 24px; text-align: center;\">Piano Music Box Bottom Winding Kit</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse aspect-video max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s1/default/283ea634fd5746d6823c7d75faf866f9/K014.png\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!--图片展示-->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\">\n<div 